## System Context

The component is positioned between heterogeneous modeling tools and model repositories within an SDV engineering toolchain. It receives a source model together with the target metamodel or modeling-language definition, invokes an LLM to perform semantic model transformation, and subsequently validates the generated model before making it available to downstream engineering tools.

Typical transformation paths include:

Ecore → Ecore
SysML v2 → SysML v2
Ecore → SysML v2
SysML v2 → Ecore

## Compliant to

Eclipse Modeling Framework (EMF)/Ecore and SysML v2 concepts; additional modeling languages and standards can be integrated through corresponding parsers, target definitions, and validators.
